Keynote talks
Another highlight of our program is the three exciting keynote talks, presented by Prof. Jong Park,
KAIST, on “Human-Centric Natural Language Processing”; Prof. Emily M. Provost, University of Mi-
chigan, on “From Speech to Emotion to Mood: Mental Health Modeling in Real-World Environments” &
Prof. Christopher Manning from Stanford University, on “Academic NLP research in the Age of LLMs:
Nothing but blue skies!”
